E4FD                             ;  Console layer: getk returns a waiting key in A (zero flag clear), or
E4FD                             ;  A = 0 with the zero flag set when none is waiting. CONOUT prints A.
E4FD                             ;  Both keep X and Y. In the unchecked build getk is the host's KEY itself.
E4FD                             ; =============================================================================
E4FD                          IF   1-CHECKED   
                    GETK:     EQU   KEY   ; the host's routine does the whole job
E4FD                          ENDIF      
E4FD                          IF   CHECKED   
E4FD   AD 34 04     GETK:     LDA   KEYBUF   ; a key held back by the break check
