E521                             ; character just read, then end. For example: S @ 245
E521                             ; The stacks are left as they are: the hardware stack wraps inside its page,
E521                             ; so the calls below work whatever state it is in.
E521   20 03 FF     ERROR:    JSR   CONOUT   
